    "body": "Regarding `onrender` it sounds like you're after the [`ResizeObserver` API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ResizeObserver). While it doesn't really fire every time the style is recalculated, it does once per rendering frame, after the browser did its auto-recalc, which seems a lot more appropriate for your use case.  ",
